GH-PGD License Notice

The released GH-PGD annotation-oriented materials are provided for academic and non-commercial research use.

This license applies only to the released annotation-oriented materials, including semantic annotation masks, instance masks, COCO-style JSON annotation files, patch-level geographic indices, patch-level geographic extents, metadata files, and related documentation.

This release does not include Google Earth imagery, original very-high-resolution source images, original large GeoTIFF images, quadrant GeoTIFF images, or 512 × 512 RGB image patches. Such imagery is not redistributed and remains subject to the terms of use and licensing restrictions of the corresponding imagery providers.

Users should cite the accompanying paper when using GH-PGD.
